{
  "name": "MXR Phase 90 Script",
  "version": 3,
  "author": "LiveWDF",
  "category": "Modulation",
  "description": "Four matched 2N5952 all-pass stages and the LM741 relaxation oscillator, based on the General Guitar Gadgets script-era redraw (2015-06-30), with the optional feedback branch omitted. The 5.1 V zener reference is represented by ideal rails. Oscillator compensation limits sub-sample switching. C7 is initialized below the comparator threshold to start the oscillator. The switch, indicator and battery protection are outside the engaged audio path.",
